<title>USA: ACI Telecentrics shares inch up after debut.</title>
<headline>ACI Telecentrics shares inch up after debut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of the initial public offering ACI Telecentrics Inc were up 1/2 at 5-1/2 in late afternoon trading Monday.</p>
<p>ACI Telecentrics, a Minneapolis, Minn.-based telecommunications company, made its market debut Monday with shares hitting a high of 6-1/4, after opening at 5-3/4.</p>
<p>Lead underwriter for the deal, Miller, Johnson &amp; Kuehn Inc, said 1.4 million common shares were offered at a price of $5 a share.</p>
